.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SS "template<uint32_t dim>
.br
class csmp::FaceConstructionData< dim >"Container of pairs of pointers to \fBElement\fP objects juxtaposed along a shared face identified by its local face number\&. Used in the construction of \fBBoundary\fP and \fBSplitBoundary\fP objects\&. 

The juxtaposed elements must have the same dimension as the model\&. The first element in the pair is the inside one and the second one the outside one\&. Material values identify which regions they belong to\&. There is also a \fBFace\fP or \fBInterFace\fP patch number used to identify the new modelsubdomain that will be created with the help of \fBFaceConstructionData\fP\&.

.PP
\fBAttention\fP
.RS 4
\fBFaceConstructionData\fP is populated by the function
.RE
.PP
\fBhigherDimensionalNeighbors( csmp::Element<dim>&, const csmp::Index& )\fP; 
